{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Henbane.</b> Now wine is like the venom of the serpents' wrath." "<b>And the head of vipers.</b> Like על חור פתן. And if it is with alef, it is like its companions with vav." "<b>Cruel.</b> Powerful, and the alef is added like the alef in אצבע and אזרוע."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {1 "The cross-reference is to Isaiah 11:8 על חור פתן; the second sentence addresses whether פתנים has an alef, comparing it to similar forms spelled with vav."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:09.728003784Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}